{"candidateAnswer":"It makes all the effort feel worthwhile and rewarding","evidence":"[D19:9 | 12:13 am on 15 September, 2023] Dave: Thanks, Calvin! It's so satisfying to see this brought back to life, especially with people's reactions when they see the finished product - makes all the hard work worth it.","itemId":"urn:uuid:ec6829b5-b456-5edc-935e-1c510229ff9f","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:74af3c393d533116cf2a615baea9a2004971f514219e3f1bef36725c9d7d0e95","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"How does Dave feel about the reactions of people when they see the finished restoration project?","referenceAnswer":"satisfying and worth the hard work","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"74af3c393d533116cf2a615baea9a2004971f514219e3f1bef36725c9d7d0e95"}}]}